={{ JSON.stringify({
  model: "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  max_tokens: 300,
  messages: [{
    role: "user",
    content: `You are a QA engineer reviewing a failed calculation check.

Endpoint: ${$json.endpoint}
Expected stress score: ${$json.expected_value}
Actual API value: ${$json.actual_value}
Delta: ${$json.delta}
Severity: ${$json.severity}
RR intervals: ${JSON.stringify($json.rr_intervals)}

In 2-3 sentences, identify the most likely root cause (e.g. rounding, stale cache, formula drift, bad input data) and suggest one specific follow-up test to confirm it. Respond ONLY with JSON: {"likely_cause": "", "suggested_test": "", "confidence": ""}`
  }]
}) }}

